   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "This table contains data for the first five schools (alphabetically) that fielded an NCAA Division I men’s basketball team in the 2018–2019 season. It shows the total number of field goals each team scored (FG) and the total number of three-point field goals they scored (3P). Create a scatter plot without technology of 3P vs. FG.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\"><caption>(source: www.sports-reference.com)</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>School</th>\n<th>FG</th>\n<th>3P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Abilene Christian</td>\n<td>897</td>\n<td>251</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air Force</td>\n<td>802</td>\n<td>234</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Akron</td>\n<td>797</td>\n<td>297</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alabama A&amp;M</td>\n<td>736</td>\n<td>182</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alabama-Birmingham</td>\n<td>906</td>\n<td>234</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
